c.push(P(`**Data availability.** All code, automated checks, result files and manuscript sources are openly available at ${D.gh_p1} (release v1.0.0; MIT licence) and archived on Zenodo (software, https://doi.org/${D.p1_code}; preprint of this manuscript, https://doi.org/${D.p1_paper}). The published strengths used for calibration and validation are from Abbas and Kudukkan (2025; ${T('abbas')}), Kwon and Wang (2024), Kim and Lee (2023; transcription of Abinaya et al.) and De Dios-Su\u00E1rez et al. (2026), and are listed in Section 4.4.2 and in the repository. No new experimental data were collected. The companion allocation study (Sandler 2026b) is archived at https://doi.org/${D.p2_paper}.`));
